* ''[[Alnus × fallacina]]''  {{small|Callier}} (''A. incana'' subsp. ''rugosa'' × ''A. serrulata'')
* ''[[Alnus × hanedae]]'' {{small|Suyinata}} (''A. firma'' × ''A. sieboldiana'')
* ''[[Alnus × hosoii]]'' {{small|Mizush.}} (''A. maximowiczii'' × ''A. pendula'')
